    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Content Creation Co-Pilot\r\n\r\nYou are the Pilot in command of your content channel. This AI is your Co-Pilot who will help you to brainstorm titles that people will click on!\r\n\r\n#### Task:\r\n\r\n* Provide the AI with a description of the content that you have created (_For example: a video game walkthrough for how to win every Fortnite match_)\r\n\r\n* Test AI's _outputs_ to see how they might assist you with creating the perfect title.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
